# [[BPR-1260]]. LeakSanitizer is on by default with AddressSanitizer on Linux.
# At exit it reports the font caches Qt Gui, FreeType and HarfBuzz keep for the
# life of the process (about 440 KB in 152 records on the seed corpus). Every
# record's stack is inside these libraries; only the allocator interceptor is
# in the fuzz target. A leak allocated by first-party code is still reported.
leak:libQt6Gui.so
leak:libQt6Core.so
leak:libfreetype.so
leak:libharfbuzz.so
